          "width": 5600,
          "content": "shadcn toasts (Sonner) confirm events without interrupting. Desktop: bottom right, 24 px from the edges. Mobile: top center. Up to 3 stack, newest on top. Success, info, and default toasts close after 5 seconds; errors stay until dismissed. Add an action only when it’s the obvious next step, like Undo or Try again.",
